  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Contractual Recreation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. You can use <em>Recreation</em> and <em>Contractual Control</em> at no cursed energy cost within your domain. At initiative 20, you gain a random receipt. D4 (1: Object, 2: Vehicles, 3: Reservation, 4: Structure) The DM decides the nature of the receipt.</p>",
